				{
					id: "190ADF43CA639731"
					item: {
						Count: 1
						id: "minecraft:written_book"
						tag: {
							author: "SerenSantiago"
							pages: [
								"{\"text\":\"\\n WORLDLY GALAXIES IV\\n \\n  REKINDLE THE MAGIC\\n     THAT WAS LOST.\\n\\n     Made by Seren\\n Santiago & Team Fuse\\n-------------------\\n  \\n  Join Us On Discord:\\n  discord.com/invite/\\n      W8PvChP92D\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Welcome to Worldly Galaxies IV, the newest iteration of the hit questing modpack quadrilogy. This booklet is meant to serve as a guide to introduce you to the pack, the minds behind it, and what is planned for its (fruitful!) future.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"QUESTS:\\nThe quest book is meant to serve as a loose guide in your adventures. The quests can be subdivided into 3 groups:\\n- Beginner's Tutorial\\n- Immersive\\n- Challenges\\nBeginner's Tutorial quests are guiding you along the way for\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"mods that may typically be a bit difficult to start out on. Immersive quest lines guide you through an entire mod, and have milestone quests to get you to the end of a mod's progression system. Challenges, while mostly optional, net great rewards but can be very difficult.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"DEVELOPERS:\\nSeren Santiago\\nYT: @SerenSantiago\\nTW: @SerenSantiagoTV\\n\\nLunabups\\nTW: @Lunabups\\n\\nParzivalls\\nTW: @parzivalls\\n\\nYT = YouTube\\nTW = Twitch\\n\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"FUTURE PLANS:\\nMore Quests\\nRecipe Balancing\\nConfig Balancing\\n\\nAll of these will be done update-by-update, and more information can be found via the Roadmap in our Discord, or on the CurseForge page.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"We want to work with the Community as much as possible on this version of the pack to make it even bigger and better than ever. With that, if you have a suggestion please drop it in the comments on CurseForge or on Discord, that way we see each and every one of them!\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"I think that's it. With that, I hope you enjoy what we've put together for Worldly Galaxies 4, and have a blast playing it. There is more coming, stay tuned, but for now, get to playing! See you on the flip side.\\n\\n-Seren Santiago\"}"
							]
							title: "欢迎"
						}
					}
					type: "item"
				}
			]
